/*
 * Implements validation for the `__pragma!parameter_type(F, i)` construct.
 *
 * The pragma gives the type of a parameter of a function, selected by its
 * index or by its name, as `__pragma!field_type` gives the type of a field.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::pragma::parameter_type
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/pragma/parameter_type.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
